==Battleground==
*4 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the very low magnifications of the enemies here, spamming tanky Cats like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] will probably be enough to beat the stage.

